  m_text: The police have identified a large-scale coining operation. They know they
    use cheap substances in the place of real silver coins. They are accusing a person
    called Johnny LeCriminal. They give you a sample of coins that you suspect is
    theirs. Are these fake coins, and more importantly, can you acquit or indict
    Johnny before his trial, which is in thirty seconds? Press G to grab the silver
    sample and R to release it into the test tube. Oh, and remember - silver compounds
    don't dissolve in water.
